            "source": "",
            "source_reference": "2:45",
            "source_fingerprint": "",
            "source_excerpt": "",
            "support": "pending",
            "rationale": ""
          },
          {
            "categories": [
              "legal"
            ],
            "statement": "A strict reading, reported from Sufyān al-Thawrī and al-Ḥasan, treats prayer without humility as invalid.",
            "proposition": "",
            "source": "",
            "source_reference": "2:45",
            "source_fingerprint": "",
            "source_excerpt": "",
            "support": "pending",
            "rationale": ""
          },
          {
            "categories": [
              "legal"
            ],
            "statement": "The other ruling does not treat a loss of focus like a failure to intend worship or to perform its required acts.",
            "proposition": "",
            "source": "",
            "source_reference": "2:45",
            "source_fingerprint": "",
            "source_excerpt": "",
            "support": "pending",
            "rationale": ""
          },
          {
            "categories": [
              "legal"
            ],
            "statement": "This latter ruling is adopted here.",
            "proposition": "",
            "source": "",
            "source_reference": "2:45",
            "source_fingerprint": "",
            "source_excerpt": "",
            "support": "pending",
            "rationale": ""
          },
          {
            "categories": [
              "legal"
            ],
            "statement": "It does not make carelessness desirable or excuse missing a required act.",
            "proposition": "",
            "source": "",
            "source_reference": "2:45",
            "source_fingerprint": "",
            "source_excerpt": "",
            "support": "pending",
            "rationale": ""
          },
          {
            "categories": [
              "legal"
            ],
            "statement": "The person still seeks to pray with his whole heart, not merely to do the least that makes his prayer valid.",
            "proposition": "",
            "source": "",
            "source_reference": "2:45",
            "source_fingerprint": "",
            "source_excerpt": "",
            "support": "pending",
